    text: "Affected northbound trips:\r\n9:02 am from Southmoor Station\r\n10:32 am from Southmoor Station\r\n12:02 pm from Southmoor Station\r\n1:32 pm from Southmoor Station\r\n3:02 pm from Southmoor Station\r\n4:32 pm from Southmoor Station\r\n6:02 pm from Southmoor Station\r\n\nAffected southbound trips:\r\n9:56 am from Union Station Track 12\r\n11:26 am from Union Station Track 12\r\n12:56 pm from Union Station Track 12\r\n2:26 pm from Union Station Track 12\r\n3:56 pm from Union Station Track 12\r\n5:26 pm from Union Station Track 12\r\n6:56 pm from Union Station Track 12"
